Was KNOWNBUG with the headers of libstdc++ 16 (gcc 16) only: _Rb_tree<late>
named while `late' was only declared left `_S_key(const _Node &)' with an
unresolved parameter type (its `_Node' typedef kept lazily), so every call
found no match and the body was dropped.  Fixed in round 161
(cpp11_class_template_of_class_completed_later).  Runs where the host gcc is
>= 16 (tag libstdcxx16).
